---
description: Route every TapCraft platform task to the tapcraft skill.
alwaysApply: true
---

If the user mentions TapCraft/tapcraft, the repository depends on
`com.amanotes.tapcraft-kit`, or the task changes a game built for the TapCraft
platform, load and follow the `tapcraft` skill before planning, reviewing, or
editing. TapCraft asset, lifecycle, build, storage, and publishing contracts
override generic Cocos defaults.
